  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\ntoday I joined #discord:half-shot.uk but landed in different rooms on my two accounts.\r\n\r\nI think matrix.org still links the alias to an old room (`!qPNOnUsNsZrToFZqxB:half-shot.uk`). My other account landed in the correct, new room (`!OluOzqbTJgecdDIuKn:half-shot.uk`). Both are v1 rooms.\r\n\r\nOther matrix.org users seem to be having the same issue. The old room saw a few people joining and leaving since Oct 2018 when people stopped using it.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- Use an account on matrix.org.\r\n- Join `#discord:half-short.uk`.\r\n\r\nI expected to join `!OluOzqbTJgecdDIuKn:half-shot.uk` but instead joined `!qPNOnUsNsZrToFZqxB:half-shot.uk`.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n<!-- Was this issue identified on matrix.org or another homeserver? -->\r\n- **Homeserver**: matrix.org",
